      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the persona. To make the debate more intense for the students, could you expand on the specific arguments the administrator would use regarding the capacity of the local populations? Like, how would he justify why they aren't ready for self-rule or why they actually *need* this external guidance to function in a modern world?",
